  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ee4e0779-b6e8-4b8b-93f4-3f62f8c54907-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 220px;\" /><br />Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math> be the thickness of the plank</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msub><mi>&#965;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>&#965;</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>&#965;</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mi>&#965;</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> number of planks are required to stop a bullet, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>&#965;</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>m</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi>&#965;</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi>&#965;</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mrow><msubsup><mi>&#965;</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math></p>",
